  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership for Agile Governance and Climate Engagement (PACE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PACE is designed to support more accountable and inclusive institutions to respond to Nigeria&#x2019;s governance and climate change challenges.  This is a governance programme, seeking to address the governance challenges that undermine development and perpetuate social exclusion in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
